 "1": "<figure class=\"fig\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 720 356\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"The word 0x12345678 stored at addresses 1000 to 1003 in big-endian and little-endian order\">\n<text x=\"24\" y=\"46\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:600\">Word 0x12345678</text>\n<text x=\"24\" y=\"66\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:13px\">in a register</text>\n<rect x=\"230\" y=\"26\" width=\"75\" height=\"44\" style=\"fill:var(--live-soft);stroke:var(--live);stroke-width:2\"/>\n<rect x=\"305\" y=\"26\" width=\"75\" height=\"44\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n<rect x=\"380\" y=\"26\" width=\"75\" height=\"44\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n<rect x=\"455\" y=\"26\" width=\"75\" height=\"44\" style=\"fill:var(--next-soft);stroke:var(--next);stroke-width:2\"/>\n<text x=\"267.5\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:var(--mono)\">12</text>\n<text x=\"342.5\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:var(--mono)\">34</text>\n<text x=\"417.5\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:var(--mono)\">56</text>\n<text x=\"492.5\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:var(--mono)\">78</text>\n<text x=\"267.5\" y=\"90\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:600\">MSB</text>\n<text x=\"492.5\" y=\"90\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:600\">LSB</text>\n<text x=\"267.5\" y=\"107\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:13px\">bits 31–24</text>\n<text x=\"492.5\" y=\"107\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:13px\">bits 7–0</text>\n<line x1=\"24\" y1=\"122\" x2=\"696\" y2=\"122\" style=\"stroke:var(--line2);stroke-width:1;stroke-dasharray:4 4\"/>\n<text x=\"165\" y=\"142\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:600\">Big-endian</text>\n<text x=\"575\" y=\"142\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:600\">Little-endian</text>\n<rect x=\"110\" y=\"152\" width=\"110\" height=\"42\" style=\"fill:var(--live-soft);stroke:var(--live);stroke-width:2\"/>\n<rect x=\"110\" y=\"194\" width=\"110\" height=\"42\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n<rect x=\"110\" y=\"236\" width=\"110\" height=\"42\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n<rect x=\"110\" y=\"278\" width=\"110\" height=\"42\" style=\"fill:var(--next-soft);stroke:var(--next);stroke-width:2\"/>\n<rect x=\"520\" y=\"152\" width=\"110\" height=\"42\" style=\"fill:var(--next-soft);stroke:var(--next);stroke-width:2\"/>\n<rect x=\"520\" y=\"194\" width=\"110\" height=\"42\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n<rect x=\"520\" y=\"236\" width=\"110\" height=\"42\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n<rect x=\"520\" y=\"278\" width=\"110\" height=\"42\" style=\"fill:var(--live-soft);stroke:var(--live);stroke-width:2\"/>\n<text x=\"100\" y=\"179\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:var(--mono)\">1000</text>\n<text x=\"100\" y=\"221\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:var(--mono)\">1001</text>\n<text x=\"100\" y=\"263\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:var(--mono)\">1002</text>\n<text x=\"100\" y=\"305\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:var(--mono)\">1003</text>\n<text x=\"510\" y=\"179\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:var(--mono)\">1000</text>\n<text x=\"510\" y=\"221\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:var(--mono)\">1001</text>\n<text x=\"510\" y=\"263\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:var(--mono)\">1002</text>\n<text x=\"510\" y=\"305\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:var(--mono)\">1003</text>\n<text x=\"165\" y=\"179\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:var(--mono)\">12</text>\n<text x=\"165\" y=\"221\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:var(--mono)\">34</text>\n<text x=\"165\" y=\"263\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:var(--mono)\">56</text>\n<text x=\"165\" y=\"305\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:var(--mono)\">78</text>\n<text x=\"575\" y=\"179\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:var(--mono)\">78</text>\n<text x=\"575\" y=\"221\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:var(--mono)\">56</text>\n<text x=\"575\" y=\"263\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:var(--mono)\">34</text>\n<text x=\"575\" y=\"305\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:var(--mono)\">12</text>\n<text x=\"360\" y=\"200\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:13px\">byte address</text>\n<text x=\"360\" y=\"218\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:13px\">increases downward</text>\n<text x=\"165\" y=\"344\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:13px\">lowest address holds the MSB, 12</text>\n<text x=\"575\" y=\"344\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:13px\">lowest address holds the LSB, 78</text>\n</svg>\n<figcaption><b>Figure 2.1.1</b> One 32-bit word, 0x12345678, stored at byte addresses 1000 to 1003. Big-endian puts the MSB (orange) first; little-endian puts the LSB (green) first. Both machines call this \"the word at address 1000\".</figcaption>\n</figure>",
 "2": "<figure class=\"fig\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 720 414\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A loop that adds four numbers, laid out in memory with the branch back to LOOP\">\n<defs><marker id=\"m221\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" style=\"fill:var(--live)\"/></marker></defs>\n<text x=\"230\" y=\"28\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:600\">Program (4-byte instructions)</text>\n<text x=\"610\" y=\"28\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:600\">Data</text>\n<rect x=\"80\" y=\"40\" width=\"300\" height=\"36\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:1.5\"/>\n<rect x=\"80\" y=\"76\" width=\"300\" height=\"36\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:1.5\"/>\n<rect x=\"80\" y=\"112\" width=\"300\" height=\"36\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:1.5\"/>\n<rect x=\"80\" y=\"148\" width=\"300\" height=\"36\" style=\"fill:var(--accent-soft);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:1.5\"/>\n<rect x=\"80\" y=\"184\" width=\"300\" height=\"36\" style=\"fill:var(--accent-soft);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:1.5\"/>\n<rect x=\"80\" y=\"220\" width=\"300\" height=\"36\" style=\"fill:var(--accent-soft);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:1.5\"/>\n<rect x=\"80\" y=\"256\" width=\"300\" height=\"36\" style=\"fill:var(--accent-soft);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:1.5\"/>\n<rect x=\"80\" y=\"292\" width=\"300\" height=\"36\" style=\"fill:var(--live-soft);stroke:var(--live);stroke-width:2\"/>\n<rect x=\"80\" y=\"328\" width=\"300\" height=\"36\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:1.5\"/>\n<g fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:var(--mono)\">\n<text x=\"70\" y=\"63\" text-anchor=\"end\">1000</text><text x=\"92\" y=\"63\">Load R2, N</text>\n<text x=\"70\" y=\"99\" text-anchor=\"end\">1004</text><text x=\"92\" y=\"99\">Clear R3</text>\n<text x=\"70\" y=\"135\" text-anchor=\"end\">1008</text><text x=\"92\" y=\"135\">Move R4, #NUM1</text>\n<text x=\"70\" y=\"171\" text-anchor=\"end\">1012</text><text x=\"92\" y=\"171\">LOOP: Load R5, (R4)</text>\n<text x=\"70\" y=\"207\" text-anchor=\"end\">1016</text><text x=\"92\" y=\"207\">Add R3, R3, R5</text>\n<text x=\"70\" y=\"243\" text-anchor=\"end\">1020</text><text x=\"92\" y=\"243\">Add R4, R4, #4</text>\n<text x=\"70\" y=\"279\" text-anchor=\"end\">1024</text><text x=\"92\" y=\"279\">Subtract R2, R2, #1</text>\n<text x=\"70\" y=\"315\" text-anchor=\"end\">1028</text><text x=\"92\" y=\"315\">Branch_if_[R2]&gt;0 LOOP</text>\n<text x=\"70\" y=\"351\" text-anchor=\"end\">1032</text><text x=\"92\" y=\"351\">Store R3, SUM</text>\n</g>\n<path d=\"M380,310 H420 V166 H384\" style=\"fill:none;stroke:var(--live);stroke-width:2.5\" marker-end=\"url(#m221)\"/>\n<text x=\"430\" y=\"290\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:13px\">taken while</text>\n<text x=\"430\" y=\"307\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:13px\">R2 &gt; 0</text>\n<text x=\"392\" y=\"351\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:13px\">falls through when R2 = 0</text>\n<rect x=\"540\" y=\"40\" width=\"140\" height=\"36\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--line2);stroke-width:1.5\"/>\n<rect x=\"540\" y=\"76\" width=\"140\" height=\"36\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--line2);stroke-width:1.5\"/>\n<rect x=\"540\" y=\"112\" width=\"140\" height=\"36\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--line2);stroke-width:1.5\"/>\n<rect x=\"540\" y=\"148\" width=\"140\" height=\"36\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--line2);stroke-width:1.5\"/>\n<rect x=\"540\" y=\"184\" width=\"140\" height=\"36\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--line2);stroke-width:1.5\"/>\n<rect x=\"540\" y=\"220\" width=\"140\" height=\"36\" style=\"fill:var(--next-soft);stroke:var(--next);stroke-width:2\"/>\n<g fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:var(--mono)\">\n<text x=\"530\" y=\"63\" text-anchor=\"end\">2000</text><text x=\"552\" y=\"63\">N = 4</text>\n<text x=\"530\" y=\"99\" text-anchor=\"end\">2004</text><text x=\"552\" y=\"99\">NUM1 = 5</text>\n<text x=\"530\" y=\"135\" text-anchor=\"end\">2008</text><text x=\"552\" y=\"135\">12</text>\n<text x=\"530\" y=\"171\" text-anchor=\"end\">2012</text><text x=\"552\" y=\"171\">7</text>\n<text x=\"530\" y=\"207\" text-anchor=\"end\">2016</text><text x=\"552\" y=\"207\">9</text>\n<text x=\"530\" y=\"243\" text-anchor=\"end\">2020</text><text x=\"552\" y=\"243\">SUM = 33</text>\n</g>\n<text x=\"80\" y=\"396\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:13px\">Every fetch: IR ← [[PC]], then PC ← [PC] + 4. The branch overwrites PC with 1012.</text>\n</svg>\n<figcaption><b>Figure 2.2.1</b> A loop that adds N = 4 numbers. The shaded body (1012 to 1028) runs four times; the orange branch sends the PC back to LOOP while R2 &gt; 0, and the program falls through to the Store when R2 reaches 0. SUM shows the value after the run.</figcaption>\n</figure>",
 "3": "<figure class=\"fig\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 720 326\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"MIPS R, I and J instruction formats with field widths and an encoded example of each\">\n<g style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:600\" fill=\"currentColor\">\n<text x=\"60\" y=\"22\">R-type · add $t0, $s1, $s2</text>\n<text x=\"60\" y=\"130\">I-type · lw $t0, 32($s3)</text>\n<text x=\"60\" y=\"238\">J-type · j 0x00400018</text>\n</g>\n<g style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:600;font-family:var(--mono)\" fill=\"var(--accent)\" text-anchor=\"end\">\n<text x=\"700\" y=\"22\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\">= 0x02324020</text>\n<text x=\"700\" y=\"130\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\">= 0x8E680020</text>\n<text x=\"700\" y=\"238\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\">= 0x08100006</text>\n</g>\n<rect x=\"60\" y=\"30\" width=\"120\" height=\"40\" style=\"fill:var(--live-soft);stroke:var(--live);stroke-width:2\"/>\n<rect x=\"180\" y=\"30\" width=\"100\" height=\"40\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n<rect x=\"280\" y=\"30\" width=\"100\" height=\"40\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n<rect x=\"380\" y=\"30\" width=\"100\" height=\"40\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n<rect x=\"480\" y=\"30\" width=\"100\" height=\"40\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n<rect x=\"580\" y=\"30\" width=\"120\" height=\"40\" style=\"fill:var(--live-soft);stroke:var(--live);stroke-width:2\"/>\n<g style=\"font-size:14px\" fill=\"currentColor\" text-anchor=\"middle\">\n<text x=\"120\" y=\"55\">op (6)</text><text x=\"230\" y=\"55\">rs (5)</text><text x=\"330\" y=\"55\">rt (5)</text><text x=\"430\" y=\"55\">rd (5)</text><text x=\"530\" y=\"55\">shamt (5)</text><text x=\"640\" y=\"55\">funct (6)</text>\n</g>\n<g style=\"font-size:13px;font-family:var(--mono)\" fill=\"currentColor\" text-anchor=\"middle\">\n<text x=\"120\" y=\"92\">0 = 000000</text><text x=\"230\" y=\"92\">17 = 10001</text><text x=\"330\" y=\"92\">18 = 10010</text><text x=\"430\" y=\"92\">8 = 01000</text><text x=\"530\" y=\"92\">0 = 00000</text><text x=\"640\" y=\"92\">32 = 100000</text>\n</g>\n<rect x=\"60\" y=\"138\" width=\"120\" height=\"40\" style=\"fill:var(--live-soft);stroke:var(--live);stroke-width:2\"/>\n<rect x=\"180\" y=\"138\" width=\"100\" height=\"40\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n<rect x=\"280\" y=\"138\" width=\"100\" height=\"40\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n<rect x=\"380\" y=\"138\" width=\"320\" height=\"40\" style=\"fill:var(--next-soft);stroke:var(--next);stroke-width:2\"/>\n<g style=\"font-size:14px\" fill=\"currentColor\" text-anchor=\"middle\">\n<text x=\"120\" y=\"163\">op (6)</text><text x=\"230\" y=\"163\">rs (5)</text><text x=\"330\" y=\"163\">rt (5)</text><text x=\"540\" y=\"163\">immediate (16)</text>\n</g>\n<g style=\"font-size:13px;font-family:var(--mono)\" fill=\"currentColor\" text-anchor=\"middle\">\n<text x=\"120\" y=\"200\">35 = 100011</text><text x=\"230\" y=\"200\">19 = 10011</text><text x=\"330\" y=\"200\">8 = 01000</text><text x=\"540\" y=\"200\">32 = 0000000000100000</text>\n</g>\n<rect x=\"60\" y=\"246\" width=\"120\" height=\"40\" style=\"fill:var(--live-soft);stroke:var(--live);stroke-width:2\"/>\n<rect x=\"180\" y=\"246\" width=\"520\" height=\"40\" style=\"fill:var(--next-soft);stroke:var(--next);stroke-width:2\"/>\n<g style=\"font-size:14px\" fill=\"currentColor\" text-anchor=\"middle\">\n<text x=\"120\" y=\"271\">op (6)</text><text x=\"440\" y=\"271\">address (26) = target ÷ 4</text>\n</g>\n<g style=\"font-size:13px;font-family:var(--mono)\" fill=\"currentColor\" text-anchor=\"middle\">\n<text x=\"120\" y=\"308\">2 = 000010</text><text x=\"440\" y=\"308\">0x100006 = 00000100000000000000000110</text>\n</g>\n</svg>\n<figcaption><b>Figure 2.3.1</b> The three MIPS formats, bit 31 on the left. Orange fields choose the operation (op, and funct in R-type), blue fields name registers, green fields carry a constant or address. Under each field is its value for the example and its binary; joining the bits gives the hex word on the right.</figcaption>\n</figure>",
 "4": "<figure class=\"fig\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 720 456\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Effective addresses for several addressing modes, using one instruction with address field 600 and register R1 holding 100\">\n<defs><marker id=\"m241\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\"/></marker>\n<marker id=\"m242\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" style=\"fill:var(--live)\"/></marker></defs>\n<rect x=\"24\" y=\"40\" width=\"196\" height=\"178\" rx=\"10\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--line2);stroke-width:1.5\"/>\n<text x=\"122\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:600\">Processor</text>\n<rect x=\"44\" y=\"76\" width=\"156\" height=\"32\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:1.5\"/>\n<rect x=\"44\" y=\"124\" width=\"156\" height=\"32\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:1.5\"/>\n<rect x=\"44\" y=\"172\" width=\"156\" height=\"32\" style=\"fill:var(--next-soft);stroke:var(--next);stroke-width:1.5\"/>\n<g fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:var(--mono)\" text-anchor=\"middle\">\n<text x=\"122\" y=\"97\">PC = 302</text><text x=\"122\" y=\"145\">R1 = 100</text><text x=\"122\" y=\"193\">R0 ← operand</text>\n</g>\n<text x=\"335\" y=\"30\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:600\">Address</text>\n<text x=\"425\" y=\"30\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:600\">Contents</text>\n<rect x=\"300\" y=\"40\" width=\"180\" height=\"32\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--line2);stroke-width:1.5\"/>\n<rect x=\"300\" y=\"72\" width=\"180\" height=\"32\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--line2);stroke-width:1.5\"/>\n<rect x=\"300\" y=\"126\" width=\"180\" height=\"32\" style=\"fill:var(--accent-soft);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:1.5\"/>\n<rect x=\"300\" y=\"158\" width=\"180\" height=\"32\" style=\"fill:var(--live-soft);stroke:var(--live);stroke-width:2\"/>\n<rect x=\"300\" y=\"190\" width=\"180\" height=\"32\" style=\"fill:var(--accent-soft);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:1.5\"/>\n<rect x=\"300\" y=\"244\" width=\"180\" height=\"32\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--line2);stroke-width:1.5\"/>\n<rect x=\"300\" y=\"298\" width=\"180\" height=\"32\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--line2);stroke-width:1.5\"/>\n<rect x=\"300\" y=\"352\" width=\"180\" height=\"32\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--line2);stroke-width:1.5\"/>\n<rect x=\"300\" y=\"406\" width=\"180\" height=\"32\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--line2);stroke-width:1.5\"/>\n<path d=\"M370,40 V104 M370,126 V222 M370,244 V276 M370,298 V330 M370,352 V384 M370,406 V438\" style=\"stroke:var(--line2);stroke-width:1.5\"/>\n<g fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:var(--mono)\" text-anchor=\"middle\">\n<text x=\"335\" y=\"61\">99</text><text x=\"425\" y=\"61\">40</text>\n<text x=\"335\" y=\"93\">100</text><text x=\"425\" y=\"93\">75</text>\n<text x=\"335\" y=\"147\">300</text><text x=\"425\" y=\"147\">Load R0</text>\n<text x=\"335\" y=\"179\">301</text><text x=\"425\" y=\"179\">600</text>\n<text x=\"335\" y=\"211\">302</text><text x=\"425\" y=\"211\">next</text>\n<text x=\"335\" y=\"265\">600</text><text x=\"425\" y=\"265\">900</text>\n<text x=\"335\" y=\"319\">700</text><text x=\"425\" y=\"319\">450</text>\n<text x=\"335\" y=\"373\">900</text><text x=\"425\" y=\"373\">250</text>\n<text x=\"335\" y=\"427\">902</text><text x=\"425\" y=\"427\">330</text>\n</g>\n<g fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:14px\" text-anchor=\"middle\">\n<text x=\"390\" y=\"120\">⋮</text><text x=\"390\" y=\"238\">⋮</text><text x=\"390\" y=\"292\">⋮</text><text x=\"390\" y=\"346\">⋮</text><text x=\"390\" y=\"400\">⋮</text>\n</g>\n<path d=\"M200,140 L296,92\" style=\"fill:none;stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\" marker-end=\"url(#m241)\"/>\n<path d=\"M300,174 H262 V252 H296\" style=\"fill:none;stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\" marker-end=\"url(#m241)\"/>\n<path d=\"M300,268 H282 V366 H296\" style=\"fill:none;stroke:var(--live);stroke-width:2.5\" marker-end=\"url(#m242)\"/>\n<g fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:13px\">\n<text x=\"492\" y=\"61\">−(R1): EA = 99</text>\n<text x=\"492\" y=\"93\">(R1) and (R1)+: EA = 100</text>\n<text x=\"492\" y=\"179\">immediate: operand 600</text>\n<text x=\"492\" y=\"265\">direct: EA = 600</text>\n<text x=\"492\" y=\"319\">indexed: EA = 600 + [R1]</text>\n<text x=\"492\" y=\"373\">indirect: EA = [600]</text>\n<text x=\"492\" y=\"427\">relative: EA = [PC] + 600</text>\n<text x=\"24\" y=\"262\">Memory is word-addressed.</text>\n<text x=\"24\" y=\"284\">Orange: indirect reads 600,</text>\n<text x=\"24\" y=\"304\">then uses 900 as the EA.</text>\n<text x=\"24\" y=\"330\">After (R1)+, R1 = 101.</text>\n<text x=\"24\" y=\"352\">−(R1) first sets R1 = 99.</text>\n</g>\n</svg>\n<figcaption><b>Figure 2.4.1</b> One instruction, <code>Load R0</code> with address field 600, read under different modes. Each right-hand label names the mode whose effective address is that row. Direct goes straight to 600; indirect (orange) reads 600 first and goes on to 900; indexed and relative add R1 or the PC to 600.</figcaption>\n</figure>",
 "5": "<figure class=\"fig\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 720 346\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"C equals A times B done by one CISC memory-to-memory instruction and by four RISC load-store instructions\">\n<defs><marker id=\"m251\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\"/></marker></defs>\n<rect x=\"12\" y=\"12\" width=\"340\" height=\"322\" rx=\"12\" style=\"fill:none;stroke:var(--line2);stroke-width:1.5\"/>\n<rect x=\"368\" y=\"12\" width=\"340\" height=\"322\" rx=\"12\" style=\"fill:none;stroke:var(--line2);stroke-width:1.5\"/>\n<text x=\"182\" y=\"36\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:600\">CISC: memory-to-memory</text>\n<text x=\"538\" y=\"36\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:600\">RISC: load/store</text>\n<rect x=\"40\" y=\"52\" width=\"90\" height=\"38\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:1.5\"/>\n<rect x=\"140\" y=\"52\" width=\"90\" height=\"38\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:1.5\"/>\n<rect x=\"240\" y=\"52\" width=\"90\" height=\"38\" style=\"fill:var(--next-soft);stroke:var(--next);stroke-width:2\"/>\n<rect x=\"392\" y=\"52\" width=\"90\" height=\"38\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:1.5\"/>\n<rect x=\"492\" y=\"52\" width=\"90\" height=\"38\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:1.5\"/>\n<rect x=\"592\" y=\"52\" width=\"90\" height=\"38\" style=\"fill:var(--next-soft);stroke:var(--next);stroke-width:2\"/>\n<g fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:var(--mono)\" text-anchor=\"middle\">\n<text x=\"85\" y=\"76\">A = 6</text><text x=\"185\" y=\"76\">B = 7</text><text x=\"285\" y=\"76\">C = 42</text>\n<text x=\"437\" y=\"76\">A = 6</text><text x=\"537\" y=\"76\">B = 7</text><text x=\"637\" y=\"76\">C = 42</text>\n</g>\n<rect x=\"40\" y=\"140\" width=\"290\" height=\"86\" rx=\"10\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--line2);stroke-width:1.5\"/>\n<text x=\"60\" y=\"162\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:13px\">Processor</text>\n<rect x=\"135\" y=\"170\" width=\"100\" height=\"44\" style=\"fill:var(--live-soft);stroke:var(--live);stroke-width:2\"/>\n<text x=\"185\" y=\"197\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:600\">ALU ×</text>\n<path d=\"M85,90 L160,166\" style=\"fill:none;stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\" marker-end=\"url(#m251)\"/>\n<path d=\"M185,90 V166\" style=\"fill:none;stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\" marker-end=\"url(#m251)\"/>\n<path d=\"M210,170 L280,94\" style=\"fill:none;stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\" marker-end=\"url(#m251)\"/>\n<text x=\"40\" y=\"262\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:var(--mono);font-weight:600\">MUL C, A, B</text>\n<text x=\"40\" y=\"286\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:13px\">1 instruction, variable length;</text>\n<text x=\"40\" y=\"306\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:13px\">2 memory reads and 1 write</text>\n<text x=\"40\" y=\"324\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:13px\">happen inside it (many cycles)</text>\n<rect x=\"392\" y=\"140\" width=\"90\" height=\"38\" style=\"fill:var(--live-soft);stroke:var(--live);stroke-width:2\"/>\n<rect x=\"492\" y=\"140\" width=\"90\" height=\"38\" style=\"fill:var(--live-soft);stroke:var(--live);stroke-width:2\"/>\n<rect x=\"592\" y=\"140\" width=\"90\" height=\"38\" style=\"fill:var(--live-soft);stroke:var(--live);stroke-width:2\"/>\n<g fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:var(--mono)\" text-anchor=\"middle\">\n<text x=\"437\" y=\"164\">$t0</text><text x=\"537\" y=\"164\">$t1</text><text x=\"637\" y=\"164\">$t2</text>\n</g>\n<path d=\"M437,90 V136\" style=\"fill:none;stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\" marker-end=\"url(#m251)\"/>\n<path d=\"M537,90 V136\" style=\"fill:none;stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\" marker-end=\"url(#m251)\"/>\n<path d=\"M637,140 V94\" style=\"fill:none;stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\" marker-end=\"url(#m251)\"/>\n<g fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:13px\">\n<text x=\"443\" y=\"118\">lw</text><text x=\"543\" y=\"118\">lw</text><text x=\"643\" y=\"118\">sw</text>\n</g>\n<path d=\"M437,178 V198 H637 V182\" style=\"fill:none;stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\" marker-end=\"url(#m251)\"/>\n<path d=\"M537,178 V198\" style=\"fill:none;stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n<text x=\"587\" y=\"216\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:13px\">mul</text>\n<g fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:var(--mono)\">\n<text x=\"392\" y=\"246\">lw  $t0, A</text>\n<text x=\"392\" y=\"264\">lw  $t1, B</text>\n<text x=\"392\" y=\"282\">mul $t2, $t0, $t1</text>\n<text x=\"392\" y=\"300\">sw  $t2, C</text>\n</g>\n<text x=\"392\" y=\"324\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:13px\">4 instructions × 4 bytes, ~1 cycle each</text>\n</svg>\n<figcaption><b>Figure 2.5.1</b> The same job, C = A × B = 42. CISC does it in one long instruction that reads and writes memory internally. RISC uses two loads, a register multiply and a store: more instructions, each simple and quick, which a pipeline can overlap.</figcaption>\n</figure>",
 "6": "<figure class=\"fig\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 720 372\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Register sets of MIPS, ARM A32 and the 8086 side by side\">\n<rect x=\"12\" y=\"12\" width=\"224\" height=\"350\" rx=\"12\" style=\"fill:none;stroke:var(--line2);stroke-width:1.5\"/>\n<rect x=\"248\" y=\"12\" width=\"224\" height=\"350\" rx=\"12\" style=\"fill:none;stroke:var(--line2);stroke-width:1.5\"/>\n<rect x=\"484\" y=\"12\" width=\"224\" height=\"350\" rx=\"12\" style=\"fill:none;stroke:var(--line2);stroke-width:1.5\"/>\n<g fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">\n<text x=\"124\" y=\"38\">MIPS · 32 × 32-bit</text><text x=\"360\" y=\"38\">ARM A32 · 16 × 32-bit</text><text x=\"596\" y=\"38\">8086 · 16-bit</text>\n</g>\n<g style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:1.5\">\n<rect x=\"24\" y=\"52\" width=\"200\" height=\"32\"/><rect x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"200\" height=\"32\"/><rect x=\"24\" y=\"128\" width=\"200\" height=\"32\"/><rect x=\"24\" y=\"166\" width=\"200\" height=\"32\"/><rect x=\"24\" y=\"204\" width=\"200\" height=\"32\"/>\n<rect x=\"260\" y=\"52\" width=\"200\" height=\"32\"/><rect x=\"260\" y=\"90\" width=\"200\" height=\"32\"/><rect x=\"260\" y=\"128\" width=\"200\" height=\"32\"/>\n<rect x=\"496\" y=\"52\" width=\"200\" height=\"32\"/><rect x=\"496\" y=\"90\" width=\"200\" height=\"32\"/><rect x=\"496\" y=\"128\" width=\"200\" height=\"32\"/><rect x=\"496\" y=\"166\" width=\"200\" height=\"32\"/><rect x=\"496\" y=\"204\" width=\"200\" height=\"32\"/>\n</g>\n<g style=\"fill:var(--live-soft);stroke:var(--live);stroke-width:1.5\">\n<rect x=\"24\" y=\"242\" width=\"200\" height=\"32\"/><rect x=\"24\" y=\"280\" width=\"200\" height=\"32\"/><rect x=\"24\" y=\"318\" width=\"200\" height=\"32\"/>\n<rect x=\"260\" y=\"166\" width=\"200\" height=\"32\"/><rect x=\"260\" y=\"204\" width=\"200\" height=\"32\"/><rect x=\"260\" y=\"242\" width=\"200\" height=\"32\"/>\n<rect x=\"496\" y=\"242\" width=\"200\" height=\"32\"/><rect x=\"496\" y=\"280\" width=\"200\" height=\"32\"/><rect x=\"496\" y=\"318\" width=\"200\" height=\"32\"/>\n</g>\n<rect x=\"260\" y=\"280\" width=\"200\" height=\"32\" style=\"fill:var(--next-soft);stroke:var(--next);stroke-width:1.5\"/>\n<g fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:13px\">\n<text x=\"34\" y=\"73\">$zero (0): always 0</text>\n<text x=\"34\" y=\"111\">$v0–$v1 (2–3): results</text>\n<text x=\"34\" y=\"149\">$a0–$a3 (4–7): arguments</text>\n<text x=\"34\" y=\"187\">$t0–$t9: temporaries</text>\n<text x=\"34\" y=\"225\">$s0–$s7 (16–23): saved</text>\n<text x=\"34\" y=\"263\">$sp (29): stack pointer</text>\n<text x=\"34\" y=\"301\">$ra (31): return address</text>\n<text x=\"34\" y=\"339\">PC (not a numbered reg)</text>\n<text x=\"270\" y=\"73\">r0–r3: arguments, result</text>\n<text x=\"270\" y=\"111\">r4–r11: variables</text>\n<text x=\"270\" y=\"149\">r12: scratch</text>\n<text x=\"270\" y=\"187\">r13 = SP: stack pointer</text>\n<text x=\"270\" y=\"225\">r14 = LR: return address</text>\n<text x=\"270\" y=\"263\">r15 = PC</text>\n<text x=\"270\" y=\"301\">CPSR flags: N Z C V</text>\n<text x=\"506\" y=\"73\">AX = AH:AL accumulator</text>\n<text x=\"506\" y=\"111\">BX = BH:BL base</text>\n<text x=\"506\" y=\"149\">CX = CH:CL count</text>\n<text x=\"506\" y=\"187\">DX = DH:DL data</text>\n<text x=\"506\" y=\"225\">SI, DI: index</text>\n<text x=\"506\" y=\"263\">SP stack, BP frame base</text>\n<text x=\"506\" y=\"301\">CS DS SS ES: segments</text>\n<text x=\"506\" y=\"339\">IP and FLAGS</text>\n</g>\n</svg>\n<figcaption><b>Figure 2.6.1</b> The registers a programmer sees. Blue rows are general-purpose; orange rows have a fixed job (stack pointer, return address, program counter, segments); green is ARM's flag register. MIPS and ARM registers are 32 bits; each 8086 general register splits into a high and a low byte.</figcaption>\n</figure>",
 "7": "<figure class=\"fig\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 720 340\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Flowchart of an if-else that computes an absolute difference, beside its MIPS code\">\n<defs><marker id=\"m271\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" style=\"fill:var(--ink)\"/></marker></defs>\n<rect x=\"60\" y=\"16\" width=\"120\" height=\"34\" rx=\"17\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--line2);stroke-width:1.5\"/>\n<text x=\"120\" y=\"38\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:14px\">Start</text>\n<path d=\"M120,50 V74\" style=\"fill:none;stroke:var(--ink);stroke-width:1.5\" marker-end=\"url(#m271)\"/>\n<path d=\"M120,76 L200,120 L120,164 L40,120 Z\" style=\"fill:var(--accent-soft);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n<text x=\"120\" y=\"125\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:600\">x &lt; y ?</text>\n<path d=\"M120,164 V194\" style=\"fill:none;stroke:var(--ink);stroke-width:1.5\" marker-end=\"url(#m271)\"/>\n<text x=\"128\" y=\"185\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:13px\">yes</text>\n<path d=\"M200,120 H270 V194\" style=\"fill:none;stroke:var(--ink);stroke-width:1.5\" marker-end=\"url(#m271)\"/>\n<text x=\"214\" y=\"112\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:13px\">no</text>\n<rect x=\"50\" y=\"198\" width=\"140\" height=\"40\" style=\"fill:var(--next-soft);stroke:var(--next);stroke-width:2\"/>\n<text x=\"120\" y=\"223\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:var(--mono)\">z = y − x</text>\n<rect x=\"210\" y=\"198\" width=\"120\" height=\"40\" style=\"fill:var(--live-soft);stroke:var(--live);stroke-width:2\"/>\n<text x=\"270\" y=\"223\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:var(--mono)\">z = x − y</text>\n<path d=\"M120,238 V282\" style=\"fill:none;stroke:var(--ink);stroke-width:1.5\" marker-end=\"url(#m271)\"/>\n<path d=\"M270,238 V282\" style=\"fill:none;stroke:var(--ink);stroke-width:1.5\" marker-end=\"url(#m271)\"/>\n<rect x=\"100\" y=\"286\" width=\"190\" height=\"36\" rx=\"18\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--line2);stroke-width:1.5\"/>\n<text x=\"195\" y=\"309\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:14px\">Exit</text>\n<text x=\"362\" y=\"30\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:600\">MIPS: x in $s0, y in $s1, z in $s2</text>\n<rect x=\"356\" y=\"42\" width=\"344\" height=\"60\" style=\"fill:var(--accent-soft);stroke:none\"/>\n<rect x=\"356\" y=\"102\" width=\"344\" height=\"60\" style=\"fill:var(--next-soft);stroke:none\"/>\n<rect x=\"356\" y=\"162\" width=\"344\" height=\"30\" style=\"fill:var(--live-soft);stroke:none\"/>\n<g fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:var(--mono)\">\n<text x=\"430\" y=\"64\">slt $t0, $s0, $s1</text>\n<text x=\"430\" y=\"94\">beq $t0, $zero, Else</text>\n<text x=\"430\" y=\"124\">sub $s2, $s1, $s0</text>\n<text x=\"430\" y=\"154\">j   Exit</text>\n<text x=\"366\" y=\"184\">Else:</text><text x=\"430\" y=\"184\">sub $s2, $s0, $s1</text>\n<text x=\"366\" y=\"214\">Exit:</text>\n</g>\n<g fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:13px\">\n<text x=\"362\" y=\"250\">Trace with x = 7, y = 19:</text>\n<text x=\"362\" y=\"270\">slt gives $t0 = 1, since 7 &lt; 19</text>\n<text x=\"362\" y=\"290\">beq is not taken ($t0 ≠ 0)</text>\n<text x=\"362\" y=\"310\">z = 19 − 7 = 12, then j Exit</text>\n</g>\n</svg>\n<figcaption><b>Figure 2.7.1</b> <code>if (x &lt; y) z = y − x; else z = x − y;</code> as a flowchart and as MIPS code. Matching colours show which instructions implement each box: blue tests the condition (branching to Else when it is false), green is the then-part ending in a jump past Else, orange is the else-part.</figcaption>\n</figure>",
 "8": "<figure class=\"fig\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 720 506\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"From C source to running program: compiler, assembler, linker with a library, loader\">\n<defs><marker id=\"m281\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" style=\"fill:var(--ink)\"/></marker></defs>\n<g style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--line2);stroke-width:1.5\">\n<rect x=\"40\" y=\"16\" width=\"260\" height=\"34\" rx=\"8\"/><rect x=\"40\" y=\"126\" width=\"260\" height=\"34\" rx=\"8\"/><rect x=\"40\" y=\"236\" width=\"260\" height=\"34\" rx=\"8\"/><rect x=\"40\" y=\"346\" width=\"260\" height=\"34\" rx=\"8\"/>\n<rect x=\"330\" y=\"236\" width=\"230\" height=\"34\" rx=\"8\"/>\n</g>\n<g style=\"fill:var(--accent-soft);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\">\n<rect x=\"40\" y=\"70\" width=\"260\" height=\"36\"/><rect x=\"40\" y=\"180\" width=\"260\" height=\"36\"/><rect x=\"40\" y=\"290\" width=\"260\" height=\"36\"/><rect x=\"40\" y=\"400\" width=\"260\" height=\"36\"/>\n</g>\n<rect x=\"40\" y=\"456\" width=\"260\" height=\"36\" style=\"fill:var(--next-soft);stroke:var(--next);stroke-width:2\"/>\n<g fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:var(--mono)\" text-anchor=\"middle\">\n<text x=\"170\" y=\"38\">sum.c  (C source)</text><text x=\"170\" y=\"148\">sum.s  (assembly)</text><text x=\"170\" y=\"258\">sum.o  (object file)</text><text x=\"170\" y=\"368\">a.out  (executable)</text>\n<text x=\"445\" y=\"258\">lib.o, libc (library)</text>\n</g>\n<g fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">\n<text x=\"170\" y=\"93\">Compiler</text><text x=\"170\" y=\"203\">Assembler</text><text x=\"170\" y=\"313\">Linker</text><text x=\"170\" y=\"423\">Loader</text><text x=\"170\" y=\"479\">Memory: running process</text>\n</g>\n<g style=\"fill:none;stroke:var(--ink);stroke-width:1.5\" marker-end=\"url(#m281)\">\n<path d=\"M170,50 V66\"/><path d=\"M170,106 V122\"/><path d=\"M170,160 V176\"/><path d=\"M170,216 V232\"/><path d=\"M170,270 V286\"/><path d=\"M170,326 V342\"/><path d=\"M170,380 V396\"/><path d=\"M170,436 V452\"/>\n<path d=\"M350,270 L304,292\"/>\n</g>\n<g fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size:13px\">\n<text x=\"330\" y=\"93\">C to assembly language for the target ISA</text>\n<text x=\"330\" y=\"196\">expands pseudo-instructions; pass 1 builds</text>\n<text x=\"330\" y=\"214\">the symbol table, pass 2 writes machine code</text>\n<text x=\"330\" y=\"306\">places modules, resolves external labels,</text>\n<text x=\"330\" y=\"324\">patches addresses using relocation info</text>\n<text x=\"330\" y=\"416\">copies text and data into memory, sets up</text>\n<text x=\"330\" y=\"434\">stack and registers, jumps to start-up code</text>\n</g>\n</svg>\n<figcaption><b>Figure 2.8.1</b> The translation hierarchy. Blue boxes are tools, white boxes are files. The linker is the step that combines several object files and library code; the loader is part of the operating system.</figcaption>\n</figure>"
}